#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:101
msgid "Three flames answer. The seal cracks, and the old wardens wake up grumpy."
msgstr ""

#. [&"vessa", "I'm here for the crown, not a lecture. Fine. Both."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:102
msgid "I'm here for the crown, not a lecture. Fine. Both."
msgstr ""

#. [&"malrik", "Put it down. That crown was never meant for someone who throws fire at her problems."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:103
msgid "Put it down. That crown was never meant for someone who throws fire at her problems."
msgstr ""

#. [&"vessa", "Then it's in the right hands. I throw fire at ALL my problems."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:104
msgid "Then it's in the right hands. I throw fire at ALL my problems."
msgstr ""

#. [&"malrik", "Keep it warm for me. The other three will come for it now."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:105
msgid "Keep it warm for me. The other three will come for it now."
msgstr ""

#. [&"narrator", "Far away, three apprentices feel the crown wake up, and begin to worry."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:106
